> **Brand VI Finalized (2026-08-21)**: The proposal's primary brand name **"落朵 / Luoduo"** and **blue-purple eight-petal mark** use Huizhou Luoduo Intelligent Technology Co., Ltd.'s registered trademarks, authorized for this Centennial Jingzhang AI Belt open design competition (open-city-ai/haidian) submission and result display. Square mark-only version in `assets/figures/luoduo-mark-square.png`. Color spine: Luoduo tech-blue #0000E5 (deep) + #29ABE2 (light) [agent.1] [agent.5] [source:LUODUO-ECOSYSTEM-AUTH].

## Design Basis and Source List

This proposal is grounded in the Centennial Jingzhang AI Belt international open call announcement and the agent-oriented taskbook [source:OFFICIAL-ANNOUNCEMENT] [source:AGENT-OPEN-CALL-TASKBOOK]. The Luoduo AI Army holds operating authorization for nine real ecosystems that anchor the proposal's delivery [source:LUODUO-ECOSYSTEM-AUTH]. Site scope relies on the repository's provisional boundary package, which is a provisional constraint rather than an official red-line [source:DATA-SRC-PROVISIONAL-BOUNDARIES-20260605] [data:geometry/site_boundary.geojson#site].

## Three-Level Scope Framework

The scheme follows a three-level framework: coordinated research area, overall design area, and key areas [depth:three_level_scope_framework]. The three levels progressively converge so that strategic judgement and delivery scale stay consistent [data:geometry/key_areas.geojson#key_areas] [standard:PROJECT-AGENT-OPEN-CALL-TASKBOOK].
## Three Positionings — Five Functions — Three Zones & Two Wings — Agent Mapping (Concept)

The table below is the scheme's internal logic mapping; all entries are **conceptual suggestions**, not settled policy or official cooperation. Evidence is tagged `[source:]` / `[agent.N]`; entries without formal cooperation evidence are marked "concept".

| Positioning | Function | Spatial carrier | Agent | Users | Operation (concept) | Evidence |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| AI innovation source | Industry support | Zhongzhiyuan / N wing | agent.2 · jt | Makers, firms, R&D | Forum+hackathon+compute (forum_hub) | [agent.2][source:LUODUO-ECOSYSTEM-AUTH] |
| Future-city living demo | Public experience | AI Origin Community | agent.3 · agent.4 | Residents, visitors, commuters | Plug-and-play retail/care/guide | [agent.3][agent.4] |
| Digital-twin governance | Long-term ops | Dazhongsi / shuttle ring | agent.6 · EMQX | Operators, public | Sensing + human review + annual events | [agent.6] |
| Open collaboration net | Convertibility | S Yuehe wing (S) | agent.2 · agent.3 | Developers, investors | city-as-repo open collaboration | [agent.2] |
| Green low-carbon resilience | Spatial clarity | Blue-green network | agent.4 · EMQX | All citizens | Blue-green + low-carbon loop | [agent.4] |

> Causal loop (concept): the chain is positioning → function → zone → agent → operation; current framing is high-level; quantified loops are tracked via metrics at implementation, not claimed as verified.

