## Luoduo Implementation Capability Reference (Huawei OLT + Copper Cable / Smart Lighting / Meal System / Luoduo Office)

> The following are **implementation capabilities and reference solutions** the applicant (Luoduo) can provide, presented as "capability / reference", **not claimed as deployed in the Jingzhang AI Belt**; inclusion is subject to the official call and site conditions [source:LUODUO-ECOSYSTEM-AUTH].

### Connectivity base: Huawei OLT + copper cable
- **Huawei OLT (optical line terminal, GPON/XG-PON)**: gigabit fiber access for campus/community, carrying multi-agent edge inference backhaul and EMQX sensing uplink.
- **Copper cable**: end-power and low-voltage wiring base for smart lighting, sensing nodes and edge boxes — a "fiber + copper" dual base.
- Status: **concept / connectable** (implement after official network & wiring conditions are met).

### Smart lighting (age-friendly / accessible)
- Edge-controlled lighting with presence sensing, adaptive brightness, low-light night guidance.
- Can serve S-04 blue-green elderly care and S-06 community elderly care: night safety lighting and fall-prevention cues for elderly and IDD groups.
- Status: **pilot concept** (Luoduo ecosystem-level, pending site verification).

### Meal ordering system (Luoduo Meal, connectable to canteens)
- Luoduo Meal (one of five business lines) offers scan-to-order, nutrition analysis and frictionless checkout.
- Can connect to community elderly canteens / meal assistance, supporting voice order, family proxy and offline counter — directly answering the review's call for IDD / elderly convenience facilities.
- Status: **ecosystem-level** (live in Luoduo ecosystem, connectable to belt meal scenarios).

### Luoduo Office architecture (8 templates + 27 Agent ops governance hub)
- Luoduo Office's 8 business templates (daily ops / data analytics / marketing / management / industry-specific / AI-advanced / knowledge / remote service) and 27 Agents.
- Can act as the Agent hub for belt operations, governance and community services, digitizing scenario-card "operator" roles (e.g., S-06 need-register -> visit -> follow-up loop).
- Status: **concept / connectable** (ops-hub reference, not deployed in belt).

## Appendix: agent.1-6 Deliverables Digest

- **Scenario cards (agent.3)**: 12 AI+ scenario cards (S-01 smart commuting to S-12 neighborhood social) mapped to Luoduo ecosystems and key areas.
- **Personas (agent.3)**: 5 personas — resident, commuter, visitor, maker, space operator.
- **Global cases (agent.2)**: 8-reference comparison table (methodological inspiration only; sources in [source:GLOBAL-SMART-CITY-CASES]):

| Case | Period | Borrowable mechanism | Lesson/failure | Our differentiation |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Sidewalk Toronto | 2017–2020 | Data governance & public participation | Privacy dispute halted project | "Ops-first + human review" avoids data centralization |
| Toyota Woven City | 2020– | Living-lab validation | Heavy asset, long cycle | Light plug-and-play, avoid demolition |
| Masdar City | 2008– | Zero-carbon paradigm | Weak accessibility, car-dependent | Slow-traffic stitch + rail first |
| Songdo | 2000s | IOC urban brain | Comms silos, low stickiness | Multi-agent orchestration + community stickiness |
| Amsterdam Smart City | 2009– | Public-private open data | Limited scale | 9 real ecosystems at scale |
| Helsinki HRI | 2010s | Open data & human services | Language/digital divide | Multilingual + offline channels |
| Xiongan | 2017– | Digital-twin base | New-area scale, not old-city | Stock renewal + seam insertion |
| Zhangjiang AI Town | 2010s | AI full-stack cluster | Industry-city separation | Three-zone-two-wing + community embed |

> Cases are method references, not proof of our results; differentiations are conceptual [agent.2].

### Brand & Capability Two-Layer Architecture (Concept)
- **Public-belt brand layer (Centennial Jingzhang AI Belt)**: the open-call's public proposition; this proposal is only a submission; Luoduo trademark is **not** the belt's official mark, designated supplier or city brand.
- **Luoduo capability layer (Luoduo Agent City)**: the 9 ecosystems & 14 agents are the capability source and submission identifier, authorized for this call [source:LUODUO-ECOSYSTEM-AUTH]; enterprise trademark is strictly separated from the public proposition.

- **Ecosystem map (agent.2)**: 9 ecosystems × 14 agents orchestrated by SkyDuo (jt).
- **Public space & landmarks (agent.4)**: 3 AI pilgrimage landmarks (LM-1/2/3) plus 7+7 component library.
- **Brand & culture (agent.5)**: "Luoduo" registered trademark LOGO (horizontal/vertical/square), Luoduo tech-blue #0000E5 + #29ABE2, three-layer narrative (Jingzhang heritage → Zhongguancun innovation → AI new culture).
- **Operations & community (agent.6)**: annual activities, developer community, 18-project three-phase roadmap.

## Metrics, Area Recalculation, and Compliance Matrix

The metric system covers land use, scale, blue-green, transport and renewal, all based on the provisional boundary with confidence labels [depth:metrics_recalculation] [metric:site_area_sqm]. Area recalculation is explicit: a full recompute is required once official red-lines arrive [metric:green_space_area_sqm].

**11 full AI+ scenario cards** (users, space, flow, data minimization, human review/exit, non-digital alt, operator, cost, pilot KPI, vulnerable-group path, status; all conceptual/pilot, not approved ops) [agent.3]:

#### S-01 Smart Commuting Shuttle (Smart Commuting Shuttle)

- **Users**: 通勤者(P-02)
- **Space**: 轨道站点周边 / TOD 接驳环
- **Flow**: APP预约→智能调度→接驳至站点→评价反馈
- **Data minimization**: 仅起终点网格码，不采集身份
- **Human review/exit**: 调度异常转人工客服；一键退出并删除行程
- **Non-digital alt**: 地面公交 + 慢行步道
- **Operator**: 公交/租赁企业(协作)
- **Cost**: 低(复用现有车队)
- **Pilot KPI**: 接驳准点率≥90% / 碳减排
- **Vulnerable-group path**: 电话预约+站点人工；无终端现场购票
- **Status**: 概念 / 试点设想

#### S-02 Heritage Study Tour (Heritage Study Tour)

- **Users**: 游客(P-03)/学生
- **Space**: 京张遗址公园
- **Flow**: 预约导览→AR叙事→研学任务→打卡
- **Data minimization**: 仅匿名参观轨迹
- **Human review/exit**: 讲解员兜底；可随时退出
- **Non-digital alt**: 纸质导览图
- **Operator**: 文旅/社区
- **Cost**: 中
- **Pilot KPI**: 研学参与数 / 满意度
- **Vulnerable-group path**: 无障碍通道+志愿者陪同
- **Status**: 概念

#### S-03 Slow-traffic Stitching (Slow-traffic Stitching)

- **Users**: 居民/通勤者
- **Space**: 缝合廊道
- **Flow**: 路径规划→慢行导航→避让
- **Data minimization**: 位置匿名网格
- **Human review/exit**: 城管兜底；误导可投诉
- **Non-digital alt**: 标识系统+人工引导
- **Operator**: 街道办
